IDI_ICON1 ICON "icon.ico"

// Resource ID 1 / type 24 (RT_MANIFEST) is what Windows looks for on an
// .exe to decide its requested elevation — CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID.
// Most of what this app does (deleting files under Program Files, writing
// HKLM, killing other users' processes, creating/removing System Restore
// points) silently fails without it; the original AutoIt tool had the same
// requirement via its own `#RequireAdmin` directive.
1 24 "app.manifest"
